<title>JAPAN: Brunei cuts Aug Seria Light to $21.05/bbl-traders.</title>
<headline>Brunei cuts Aug Seria Light to $21.05/bbl-traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has set the price of its benchmark Seria Light crude oil for August at $21.05 per barrel, down five cents from July's $21.10, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The price for Brunei's Champion crude is $20.85, also five cents down from the previous month, traders said.</p>
<p>Brunei has set a provisional price of $21.40 for September Seria Light and $21.20 for September Champion crude, they said.</p>
</text>
